direction_95 = location "Shadow Seeker" about "Shadow Seeker\nMonster which evolved in the war with Pathos by a curse which turned man into wolfman" found "Karus" karus at 909 1279 in zone 1

On offer
    Say "Hm... A stranger- It might be your first adventure here in Karus. Nice to meet you.- I am Melverick, a Sentinel at the Luferson Castle. I am at your service.-If you have time, could you do me a favor?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Here in the mainland, we have creatures called  Shadow Seekers that are notorious for causing troubles everywhere. Even now they are rampaging about at various places, so could you please help us with them?\n\nOh, you can always come and see me when you need new weapons. I can keep supporting you with weapons until you reach 35Lv."

On in_progress
    Say "Don't strain yourself. You won't be able to handle them alone."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_95

On claimable
    Show quest "Thanks a lot! I will ask a favor of you next time too."
